comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-08T21:55:27.320Z","harness:claude-code","Duplicate check before filing: searched sentry suppression, beforeSend, PmCliError suppression, host environment fault, ENOSPC and errno boundary. Nearest owners are pm-qxo5iu (closed, producer side, cited as discovered_from), pm-dqtzva (gate classified by message prose, rebound to error codes), pm-3lhth4 (open, owns the untyped host-fault family and therefore PM-CLI-2S) and pm-e70zh5 (open, owns the scheduled-failure rate). None of them covers a consumer whose classifier is producer-version dependent while its selection window is time based. Filed as the distinct residual."
  "2026-08-08T22:13:25.857Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-09: active in the coupled context-provenance tranche with pm-3zgh2c, pm-eq9dlw, pm-lu6sca, pm-b1w8vr, and pm-h75tjh. Scope is SDK-first provenance inference and resolver outcomes, typed role domains, stable entity read-back projections, and epoch-aware release classification; all other open items remain unclaimed."
  "2026-08-09T00:09:12.156Z","harness:codex","Final verification: the complete sandboxed coverage gate passed 461/461 files and 7086/7086 tests at exact 100/100/100/100, including pre-contract producer partitioning, malformed producer candidate fallback, current-contract blocking, and telemetry threshold paths."
  "2026-08-09T00:20:21.347Z","harness:codex","Delivery handoff: broad SDK/CLI tranche committed at 5b36abc75 and opened as GitHub PR #944 (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/944). Exact local evidence includes 7,086 tests across 461 files at 100/100/100/100 coverage, package/compatibility/npx/dogfood/manual acceptance, tracker/changelog/SDK/static-quality gates, and zero current dependency or GitHub security alerts. Review and exact-head CI evidence will be appended after the hosted loop."
